 ### Fail-closed via host detectors
 
+`evaluate.raw_signals` goes only to root, consumed once during this evaluation.
+Root always runs; lower layers receive constraints only when `has_children=true`.
+`plant_nodes[].parent_id`, `layer` and `kind` are metadata, not regulator selectors.
+`run` does not parse `raw_signals`. This two-layer leaf interlocks at root; actuation is null.
